## DEFERRED — golden rule (leave a note, never guess)
Live DPS / per-act gold-hr / clear-time (need game memory = CodeStage [ACTk] ban risk); Steam Market value (Inventory
Service throttled/empty this build); 12-min blue-chest (no 720s in DropCooldown); per-item origin — craft vs drop vs
market-buy (no flag, not logged); "Cube gold" alone (bundled in the ~0.5% "other" gold bucket); best-farming STAGE (no
stage→monster map); uncalibrated aggregate Types 16/4/5/7/9/10/15; Korean ItemGroup names; per-item drop %.
Optional follow-ups: Codex recipes/set bonuses; sign the installer (cert); Vercel deploy.

## GOLDEN RULE
A helper, never game-breaking. Read-only always (CodeStage anti-cheat). No fabricated data — every label calibrated from
the game's own tables/localization; honest fallback or omit. Verify EVERY change vs the LIVE save (Node + headless, all
9 tabs, 0 console errors).

## NEXT
v1.0.3 is published (web + desktop). To ship the NEXT version: bump package.json + `?v=` cache-bust, `npm run dist`,
then `gh release create v<ver> dist/TBH-HUD-Setup-<ver>.exe dist/latest.yml dist/*.blockmap --latest`.
Optional: Vercel deploy; sign the installer (cert); deepen the Codex (recipes/set bonuses).

